"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e6","era":null,"summary":"Kodolaag and Olrich visit the precognition mage Lucinka, who gives them a box and instructions for freeing Zita.","participants":["kodolaag","olrich","lucinka"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"major","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":677,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":107,"quote":"Visit Udzec tomorrow morning. Get in line behind the minotaur with a curly red mane.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Visit%20Udzec%20tomorrow%20morning.,a%20curly%20red%20mane.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Visit%20Udzec%20tomorrow%20morning.,a%20curly%20red%20mane.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e7","era":null,"summary":"At Udzec, Olrich dresses as a baby and swallows the bloodfray amulet, and Kodolaag frames the minotaur Jitka Wothis by hiding a whiskey bottle in her cape to distract the nullmages.","participants":["kodolaag","olrich","jitka-wothis","bloodfray-amulet","udzec"],"location":"udzec","importance":"major","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":677,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":122,"quote":"Carefully, carefully I rest the bottle inside, hoping it's light enough not to pull the fabric.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Carefully%2C%20carefully%20I%20rest,to%20pull%20the%20fabric.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Carefully%2C%20carefully%20I%20rest,to%20pull%20the%20fabric.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e9","era":null,"summary":"Zita brings a guard's drawing in a coloring book to life, and Kodolaag draws every guard on blight parchment and tears the pages, incapacitating them.","participants":["zita","kodolaag","olrich","blight-parchment"],"location":"udzec","importance":"major","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":677,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":148,"quote":"Electric magic ignites the paper, and the guards wail out in unison as if they're being burned alive.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Electric%20magic%20ignites%20the,they%27re%20being%20burned%20alive.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Electric%20magic%20ignites%20the,they%27re%20being%20burned%20alive.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e10","era":null,"summary":"Olrich impersonates Dovin Baan to hold off a soldier, and the trio walks out among exiting visitors.","participants":["olrich","kodolaag","zita","dovin-baan"],"location":"udzec","importance":"minor","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":677,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":150,"quote":"Citizens! Behold! It is I, your highly esteemed Grand Arbiter, Protector of Justice, Purveyor of Protocols!","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Citizens%21%20Behold%21%20It%20is,Justice%2C%20Purveyor%20of%20Protocols%21","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Citizens%21%20Behold%21%20It%20is,Justice%2C%20Purveyor%20of%20Protocols%21","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e11","era":null,"summary":"Jitka Wothis and a vampire identify Kodolaag and Olrich, who are bound by magic; Zita escapes into the crowd.","participants":["jitka-wothis","kodolaag","olrich","zita"],"location":"udzec","importance":"major","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":677,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":157,"quote":"Before we can deny it, Olrich and I are bound up in magic.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Before%20we%20can%20deny,bound%20up%20in%20magic.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Before%20we%20can%20deny,bound%20up%20in%20magic.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e12","era":null,"summary":"Kodolaag and Olrich are put to forced labor at the Exner prison site.","participants":["kodolaag","olrich","exner"],"location":"exner","importance":"minor","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":677,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":159,"quote":"As soon as we're given our uniforms, we're put to work with the rest of the non-violent offenders and pre-offenders.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=As%20soon%20as%20we%27re,non%2Dviolent%20offenders%20and%20pre%2Doffenders.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=As%20soon%20as%20we%27re,non%2Dviolent%20offenders%20and%20pre%2Doffenders.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e13","era":null,"summary":"Kodolaag has Olrich cough up the amulet and scales the Exner scaffolding, shattering the bloodfray stone and triggering a massive riot as archons close in.","participants":["kodolaag","o