23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=You%27ll%20have%20to%20set,lives%20in%20the%20undercity%2C","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"kodolaag-e0","era":{"date":"2019-01-25","era":"rna","label":"Ravnica Allegiance"},"summary":"Kodolaag meets Zita in her shop and fails to invite her to the Mockturne.","participants":["kodolaag","zita","olrich"],"location":null,"importance":"minor","page":"wiki/kodolaag","order":2131,"story_date":"","storyline":"Ravnica","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":4,"quote":"Kodolaag finally managed to invite Zita to the Mockturne.","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Kodolaag#:~:text=Kodolaag%20finally%20managed%20to,Zita%20to%20the%20Mockturne.","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Kodolaag","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Kodolaag","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Kodolaag#:~:text=Kodolaag%20finally%20managed%20to,Zita%20to%20the%20Mockturne.","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Kodolaag\", section \"History\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}},{"id":"kodolaag-e2","era":{"date":"2019-01-25","era":"rna","label":"Ravnica Allegiance"},"summary":"Kodolaag and Olrich visit Lucinka and plan a rescue.","participants":["kodolaag","olrich","lucinka"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"minor","page":"wiki/kodolaag","order":2131,"story_date":"","storyline":"Ravnica","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":7,"quote":"Determined to rescue Zita, Kodolaag, and Olrich visited Lucinka, a fallen Azorius precognition mage.","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Kodolaag#:~:text=Determined%20to%20rescue%20Zita%2C,fallen%20Azorius%20precognition%20mage.","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Kodolaag","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":""